-# An item as a mini entity card: the mockup's miniCard() (00-shared.js:173).
-# Orange frame, because an item is orange in this design language.
-#
-# Lives in layouts/ rather than items/ because three of its four callers are
-# not the items screen: the notification rows, the teacher dashboard's purchase
-# feed and the badge form's "Uwzględniają ją" list.
-#
-# `item` may be nil — a purchase whose Item was hard deleted before soft delete
-# existed. A soft-deleted item still resolves and still shows its own art.
%span.gh-card.gh-mc
  %span.gh-card-f
    %span.gh-card-i{ data: local_assigns[:inner_data] }
      - if item
        = render 'items/art', item: item
      - else
        %i.fa-solid.fa-flask{ 'aria-hidden': 'true' }
